            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë gaŋ Puɔl rɔɔdɛ inɔ, cu Pɛth-täth ruac kɛ jɔw mi di̱i̱t i̱, “Puɔl, ji̱n ci yɔ̱ŋ! Ŋäc ŋɔaanidu ɛ di̱i̱t ɛmɛ cɛ ji̱ jakä yɔ̱ŋ!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Puɔl ɛ loc i̱, “Ɣän /ka̱n yɔ̱ŋ, kuäär in gɔaa ni Pɛth-täth. Ɣän latdä ni thuɔ̱k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ thuɔ̱k kuäär ŋäcɛ ŋɔaani ti̱ti̱, kä ruacä kɛ jɛ a thil dual. Kɛ ɣöö ŋa̱cä jɛ kɛ lɔcdä ɛn ɣöö thilɛ duɔ̱ɔ̱r kɛl kä ruaacni ti̱ti̱ mi ci wi̱cdɛ bäl, kɛ ɣöö /ka̱n mɛmɛ lat gukä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuäär ni Ag-ri-pa, ji̱n, ŋääthi göök? Ŋa̱cä jɛ ɛn ɣöö ŋääthi kɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ag-ri-pa Puɔl jiök i̱, “Ji̱n pɛ̈thi kɛ ɣöö bi ɣä jakä raan kɔaar Kritho?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Puɔl ɛ loc i̱, “Cäŋɛ mi ɛ gua̱a̱th mi tɔt kiɛ gua̱a̱th mi bäär, ɣän palä Kuɔth ɛn ɣöö bi ji̱n yɛnɛ nɛy diaal tin liɛŋkɛ ɣä wa̱lɛ, dee yɛn ce̱tkɛ ɣä a thil ni kuatni ciikni ti̱ti̱.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär rɔ jiɛc kɛnɛ mädhi̱i̱r, kɛ Ber-nith amäni nɛy tëë nyuur kɛ kɛ kɛɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë wäkɛ raar cukɛ ruac kä rɔ̱ i̱, “Ɛn wut ɛmɛ thilɛ mi /cɛ lat mi dee lia̱a̱, kiɛ yieen cop.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ag-ri-pa Pɛth-täth jiök i̱, “Wut ɛmɛ dëë jɛ lony, duŋ mi /kenɛ diwdɛ nöŋ Thii-thɛr.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
